                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Optional mesh carrying the field, with one Value per mesh vertex or per mesh face. Use it for facades, terrain and any sample set whose connectivity cannot be inferred from the Points alone. Empty = derive topology from Points.</item>
